API types:

1. Web APIs (web services) — accessed over HTTP; used by many clients
(phones/tablets/PCs); e.g., REST/JSON services.
2. Local APIs — local middleware services on the machine; e.g., TAPI
(Telephony API), .NET.
3. Program APIs — make a remote program appear local via RPC; e.g., SOAP.

